KANJIDIC2-derived data

The files in this directory (`readings.ts`, `korean-readings.ts`) are
derived from the KANJIDIC2 file of the KANJIDIC Project.

  Source:     KANJIDIC Project
              https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project
  Copyright:  Electronic Dictionary Research and Development Group (EDRDG),
              Monash University, Australia. https://www.edrdg.org/
  License:    Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
              (CC BY-SA 4.0)
              https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
              https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode
  Licence statement of the EDRDG:
              https://www.edrdg.org/edrdg/licence.html

Modifications:
  - readings.ts: only <ja_on>, the base portion of <ja_kun> (okurigana
    after "." and affix "-" markers removed) and <nanori> readings are
    kept; readings are converted to katakana.
  - korean-readings.ts: only <reading r_type="korean_h"> (Hangul) values
    are kept, in the original order.
  All other KANJIDIC2 fields are removed.

